[
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "Day ten.",
"start": 0.0,
"end": 0.871
},
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "The ground shakes.",
"start": 1.031,
"end": 2.076
},
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "Dirt pours from the ceiling of your tunnel.",
"start": 2.621,
"end": 5.025
},
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "Outside, the sky is on fire.",
"start": 5.768,
"end": 8.043
},
{
"chunk": 0,
"text": "And at the door, something too big to fit inside is breathing.",
"start": 8.45,
"end": 12.896
},
{
"chunk": 2,
"text": "Ten days ago, you were asleep in your own bed.",
"start": 14.846,
"end": 17.586
},
{
"chunk": 3,
"text": "You have 10 days before the asteroid that killed the dinosaurs.",
"start": 18.136,
"end": 21.631
},
{
"chunk": 3,
"text": "Every big animal you see will die.",
"start": 22.176,
"end": 24.463
},
{
"chunk": 3,
"text": "You won't.",
"start": 25.009,
"end": 25.706
},
{
"chunk": 3,
"text": "If you stay small.",
"start": 26.449,
"end": 27.61
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "The night before was like any other.",
"start": 28.91,
"end": 30.849
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "Homework, a documentary about the dinosaurs, your phone at 23%.",
"start": 31.395,
"end": 36.073
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "\"I'll charge it in the morning.\"",
"start": 36.619,
"end": 38.14
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "In your backpack, ready for school: two textbooks, a sandwich, two chocolate bars, half a bottle of water.",
"start": 38.883,
"end": 45.512
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "And a library book you wanted to read in the break tomorrow.",
"start": 45.976,
"end": 48.612
},
{
"chunk": 4,
"text": "The Last Day of the Dinosaurs.",
"start": 49.25,
"end": 51.99
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "In the morning, there's no ceiling.",
"start": 52.541,
"end": 54.422
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "There are leaves, each one bigger than your bed.",
"start": 54.526,
"end": 57.266
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "The air is hot and wet.",
"start": 57.673,
"end": 59.135
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "No cars.",
"start": 59.275,
"end": 59.983
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "No voices.",
"start": 60.053,
"end": 60.958
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "Next to you, something rises from the ground like a tree trunk.",
"start": 61.597,
"end": 64.743
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "It isn't a tree.",
"start": 65.479,
"end": 66.466
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "It has claws.",
"start": 67.12,
"end": 68.084
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "The foot lifts, slams down one step ahead, and the ground jumps under you.",
"start": 68.63,
"end": 73.227
},
{
"chunk": 5,
"text": "You don't breathe until the footsteps fade.",
"start": 74.098,
"end": 77.372
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "Your backpack is lying next to you.",
"start": 77.921,
"end": 79.813
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "Your phone is still in your pocket.",
"start": 80.278,
"end": 81.984
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "No signal.",
"start": 82.449,
"end": 83.122
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "No internet.",
"start": 83.262,
"end": 83.993
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "Just one message that wasn't there last night.",
"start": 84.063,
"end": 86.385
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "\"Impact: 10 days.",
"start": 87.023,
"end": 88.765
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "3,000 kilometers south.\"",
"start": 88.927,
"end": 90.75
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "A prank.",
"start": 90.91,
"end": 91.537
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "A dream.",
"start": 91.642,
"end": 92.245
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "It has to be.",
"start": 92.315,
"end": 93.22
},
{
"chunk": 6,
"text": "You switch it off at 22%, and you start walking.",
"start": 93.766,
"end": 97.133
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "All afternoon, you look for a road, a wire, a plane in the sky.",
"start": 97.683,
"end": 101.619
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "Anything.",
"start": 102.164,
"end": 102.861
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "There's nothing.",
"start": 102.931,
"end": 103.801
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "In the evening, you find the owner of the foot.",
"start": 104.347,
"end": 106.692
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "A T.",
"start": 106.983,
"end": 107.296
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "rex.",
"start": 107.342,
"end": 107.842
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "12 meters, nose to tail, with a long pale scar across its snout.",
"start": 108.306,
"end": 112.753
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "For one second, its head turns toward you.",
"start": 113.391,
"end": 115.806
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "Then it walks on.",
"start": 116.352,
"end": 117.466
},
{
"chunk": 7,
"text": "It's not a dream.",
"start": 118.307,
"end": 119.735
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "That night you squeeze in between the roots of a giant tree.",
"start": 120.285,
"end": 123.42
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "You're shaking.",
"start": 123.64,
"end": 124.453
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "You don't want to sleep.",
"start": 124.511,
"end": 125.66
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "In the dark, you open your backpack, looking for anything that makes sense.",
"start": 126.206,
"end": 130.095
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "The library book.",
"start": 130.502,
"end": 131.605
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "On the cover, a T.",
"start": 132.069,
"end": 133.276
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "rex skeleton in a museum.",
"start": 133.311,
"end": 135.099
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "You don't look closely.",
"start": 135.645,
"end": 136.992
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Inside, chapter seven.",
"start": 137.63,
"end": 139.372
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Who Survived.",
"start": 139.532,
"end": 140.519
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Animals that were small.",
"start": 141.065,
"end": 142.377
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Animals that hid underground.",
"start": 143.015,
"end": 144.652
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Animals that lived near fresh water.",
"start": 145.198,
"end": 147.288
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "On the back page, with your school pen, you write a plan.",
"start": 147.926,
"end": 150.979
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Three things.",
"start": 151.2,
"end": 151.92
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Ten days.",
"start": 152.08,
"end": 152.788
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "None of them done.",
"start": 153.195,
"end": 154.1
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "You don't decide to fall asleep.",
"start": 154.507,
"end": 156.016
},
{
"chunk": 8,
"text": "Your body decides for you.",
"start": 156.121,
"end": 158.234
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "In the morning, there's a small hole by the roots.",
"start": 159.534,
"end": 162.228
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "A furry face pokes out.",
"start": 162.367,
"end": 164.155
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "Mouse-sized.",
"start": 164.898,
"end": 165.769
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "Sniffs.",
"start": 165.931,
"end": 166.593
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "Disappears.",
"start": 166.755,
"end": 167.626
},
{
"chunk": 9,
"text": "You name him Pip.",
"start": 168.033,
"end": 170.029
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "The T.",
"start": 170.579,
"end": 170.974
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "rex needs mountains of meat every day.",
"start": 171.02,
"end": 173.377
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "Pip needs a few seeds and a hole to hide in.",
"start": 173.725,
"end": 176.14
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "And your book agrees.",
"start": 176.488,
"end": 177.963
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "Scientists think that after the impact, almost no land animal heavier than about 25 kilograms survived.",
"start": 178.706,
"end": 185.312
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "You weigh 70.",
"start": 186.327,
"end": 187.267
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "So you'll have to think like Pip.",
"start": 187.406,
"end": 188.985
},
{
"chunk": 10,
"text": "Rule one: stay small.",
"start": 189.624,
"end": 192.12
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You eat half the sandwich.",
"start": 192.67,
"end": 194.307
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You save the rest.",
"start": 194.446,
"end": 195.538
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "Then you watch what Pip eats.",
"start": 196.281,
"end": 198.196
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "Small red berries, seeds from one kind of fern.",
"start": 198.939,
"end": 201.958
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "That's no guarantee.",
"start": 202.701,
"end": 203.932
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "Plenty of things a mouse can eat would kill you.",
"start": 204.187,
"end": 206.474
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "But he's a mammal, like you, and the sandwich won't last.",
"start": 207.217,
"end": 210.468
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You eat one berry.",
"start": 211.013,
"end": 212.081
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You wait.",
"start": 212.139,
"end": 212.848
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "By evening, nothing has happened.",
"start": 213.718,
"end": 215.53
},
{
"chunk": 11,
"text": "You fill your pockets.",
"start": 215.878,
"end": 217.84
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "Day three.",
"start": 218.69,
"end": 219.514
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "The bottle is empty.",
"start": 219.7,
"end": 220.815
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "Your throat is burning.",
"start": 220.861,
"end": 222.069
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "You follow the sound of water to a wide, muddy river.",
"start": 222.707,
"end": 226.039
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "At the edge, a log is floating.",
"start": 226.202,
"end": 228.199
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "It blinks.",
"start": 228.934,
"end": 229.643
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "It isn't a log.",
"start": 230.738,
"end": 231.76
},
{
"chunk": 12,
"text": "It's a crocodile.",
"start": 231.818,
"end": 233.118
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "So you don't drink from the river.",
"start": 233.668,
"end": 235.549
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "A few steps back from the bank, in the sand, you dig a pit and wait.",
"start": 236.013,
"end": 239.868
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "Water seeps in through the sand.",
"start": 240.332,
"end": 242.178
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "Slow.",
"start": 242.399,
"end": 242.979
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "Muddy.",
"start": 243.139,
"end": 243.685
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "But cleaner than the river, and far from the teeth.",
"start": 244.091,
"end": 246.89
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "You fill the bottle.",
"start": 247.528,
"end": 248.573
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "In the shallow pools, small fish are trapped.",
"start": 249.119,
"end": 252.01
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "You catch three and dry them on a hot rock.",
"start": 252.474,
"end": 254.947
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "No fire needed.",
"start": 255.133,
"end": 256.271
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "It's warm here, almost tropical, even at night.",
"start": 256.677,
"end": 259.382
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "From now on, every morning starts at the pools.",
"start": 259.928,
"end": 262.726
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "The book says freshwater animals, turtles, frogs, even crocodiles, made it through far better than most.",
"start": 263.132,
"end": 270.435
},
{
"chunk": 13,
"text": "Rule two: stay near water.",
"start": 270.9,
"end": 273.756
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Day four.",
"start": 275.055,
"end": 275.891
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "The ground shakes again.",
"start": 276.762,
"end": 278.05
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Not one footstep.",
"start": 278.097,
"end": 279.223
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Hundreds.",
"start": 279.327,
"end": 280.012
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "A herd of duck-billed dinosaurs comes along the river.",
"start": 280.419,
"end": 283.635
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Then a deep sound rolls in from far away.",
"start": 284.18,
"end": 286.874
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "You feel it in your chest more than your ears.",
"start": 287.42,
"end": 289.962
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "The herd panics.",
"start": 290.426,
"end": 291.738
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Trees snap.",
"start": 291.843,
"end": 293.004
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "You throw yourself behind a fallen log.",
"start": 293.41,
"end": 295.546
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "When the dust settles, one of them didn't get up.",
"start": 295.895,
"end": 298.089
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "And it has something you need.",
"start": 298.635,
"end": 300.353
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "A shoulder blade.",
"start": 300.411,
"end": 301.386
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Flat.",
"start": 301.491,
"end": 301.955
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "Wide.",
"start": 302.025,
"end": 302.536
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "The size of a paddle.",
"start": 302.64,
"end": 303.859
},
{
"chunk": 14,
"text": "From today, your shovel is a dinosaur.",
"start": 304.602,
"end": 306.959
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Day five.",
"start": 307.81,
"end": 308.727
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "You read the page you've been avoiding.",
"start": 309.366,
"end": 311.2
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Within an hour of the impact, burning debris falls back through the sky, all over the world.",
"start": 311.839,
"end": 317.411
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Scientists still argue about how hot it got.",
"start": 318.154,
"end": 321.092
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "In many places, hot enough to set forests on fire.",
"start": 321.556,
"end": 324.633
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "On the surface, there's nowhere to hide.",
"start": 325.376,
"end": 327.303
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Under a meter of soil, maybe.",
"start": 327.559,
"end": 329.184
},
{
"chunk": 15,
"text": "Rule three: stay underground.",
"start": 329.532,
"end": 332.609
},
{
"chunk": 16,
"text": "You find a clay bank above the river and start digging.",
"start": 333.159,
"end": 336.781
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "Now the math.",
"start": 337.331,
"end": 338.538
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "With a bone, in clay, a cave big enough to crouch in grows about 30 centimeters a day.",
"start": 339.003,
"end": 344.947
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "To get a meter of soil over your head, you have to go two and a half meters in.",
"start": 345.353,
"end": 349.579
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "That's eight days of work.",
"start": 350.125,
"end": 351.843
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "The asteroid hits on day ten.",
"start": 352.25,
"end": 354.142
},
{
"chunk": 17,
"text": "You have five.",
"start": 354.432,
"end": 355.535
},
{
"chunk": 18,
"text": "You dig until it's too dark to see, then sleep in the mud by the hole.",
"start": 356.085,
"end": 360.683
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Day six.",
"start": 361.533,
"end": 362.439
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Your hands are blistered.",
"start": 362.845,
"end": 364.18
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "You're in as deep as your arms can reach.",
"start": 364.343,
"end": 366.572
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Then the roof comes down on you.",
"start": 367.667,
"end": 369.688
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "You crawl out coughing dirt.",
"start": 370.233,
"end": 372.044
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Everything you dug, gone.",
"start": 373.14,
"end": 374.812
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Four days left.",
"start": 375.276,
"end": 376.31
},
{
"chunk": 19,
"text": "Eight days of digging.",
"start": 376.774,
"end": 378.376
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "You sit in the mud.",
"start": 378.926,
"end": 379.983
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "And there, in the bank next to your ruin, a tiny new hole.",
"start": 380.621,
"end": 384.058
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Pip followed you to the river.",
"start": 385.351,
"end": 387.011
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "His hole is tiny.",
"start": 387.197,
"end": 388.543
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "And it doesn't collapse.",
"start": 388.578,
"end": 389.855
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Because Pip doesn't dig a cave.",
"start": 390.262,
"end": 392.258
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Pip digs a tunnel exactly as wide as Pip, and one small nest at the end.",
"start": 393.129,
"end": 397.854
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "So you stop digging a cave.",
"start": 398.319,
"end": 399.898
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "You dig a tunnel exactly as wide as your shoulders.",
"start": 400.083,
"end": 402.696
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "A quarter of the dirt.",
"start": 403.16,
"end": 404.449
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Four times as fast.",
"start": 404.669,
"end": 406.016
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "And you shape the roof into an arch, because an arch pushes the weight into the walls instead of down on you.",
"start": 406.422,
"end": 411.972
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "The entrance faces north, away from where the asteroid will hit.",
"start": 412.436,
"end": 416.523
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Maybe it makes no difference.",
"start": 417.266,
"end": 418.682
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "It feels right.",
"start": 419.321,
"end": 420.331
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Stay small.",
"start": 420.491,
"end": 421.234
},
{
"chunk": 20,
"text": "Even when you dig.",
"start": 421.28,
"end": 422.929
},
{
"chunk": 21,
"text": "By dark, the tunnel swallows you to the waist.",
"start": 423.479,
"end": 425.905
},
{
"chunk": 21,
"text": "That night you sleep with your head underground and your boots outside.",
"start": 426.451,
"end": 430.491
},
{
"chunk": 21,
"text": "It's a start.",
"start": 430.956,
"end": 431.978
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Day seven.",
"start": 433.278,
"end": 434.126
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Pip doesn't run anymore.",
"start": 434.996,
"end": 436.517
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "He's waiting at the entrance in the morning.",
"start": 436.807,
"end": 438.723
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "You split your last chocolate with him, and you dig.",
"start": 439.187,
"end": 441.939
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "By noon, the blisters have burst.",
"start": 442.682,
"end": 444.656
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Your palms are raw and bleeding into the clay.",
"start": 445.062,
"end": 447.651
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "And you know a hand that breaks today digs nothing tomorrow.",
"start": 448.058,
"end": 451.03
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "So you stop.",
"start": 451.192,
"end": 452.284
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Even with three days left.",
"start": 452.748,
"end": 454.234
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "Even if the end is coming anyway.",
"start": 454.699,
"end": 456.475
},
{
"chunk": 22,
"text": "For one afternoon, you rest.",
"start": 456.765,
"end": 458.588
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "You switch the phone on.",
"start": 459.138,
"end": 460.322
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Just for a minute.",
"start": 460.427,
"end": 461.425
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "The minute becomes an hour.",
"start": 461.832,
"end": 463.445
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Photos.",
"start": 463.852,
"end": 464.537
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Your room.",
"start": 464.641,
"end": 465.349
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Your mom in the kitchen.",
"start": 465.64,
"end": 466.87
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Your friends outside school.",
"start": 466.975,
"end": 468.716
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Then a video, from a few months ago.",
"start": 469.123,
"end": 471.421
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "A class trip to a museum.",
"start": 471.828,
"end": 473.43
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "You, laughing at the camera, a giant skeleton behind you.",
"start": 473.895,
"end": 477.912
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "\"If they ever sent me back to the dinosaurs?",
"start": 478.655,
"end": 481.139
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "I'd survive.",
"start": 481.778,
"end": 482.59
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Easy.\"",
"start": 482.648,
"end": 483.322
},
{
"chunk": 23,
"text": "Your friends laughing behind the phone.",
"start": 484.065,
"end": 487.188
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "Why are you here?",
"start": 489.137,
"end": 490.194
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "What happened?",
"start": 490.298,
"end": 491.134
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "Maybe you're still asleep.",
"start": 491.772,
"end": 493.003
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "Maybe this is all a dream.",
"start": 493.658,
"end": 495.144
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "You look down at your hands.",
"start": 495.782,
"end": 497.28
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "The pain is real.",
"start": 498.376,
"end": 499.722
},
{
"chunk": 25,
"text": "It's not a dream.",
"start": 500.818,
"end": 501.84
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "You always said you'd survive.",
"start": 503.79,
"end": 505.624
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "Now you have to prove it.",
"start": 506.523,
"end": 507.8
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "When you switch it off, it's at 11%.",
"start": 508.148,
"end": 510.377
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "Ten percent, gone on home.",
"start": 510.667,
"end": 512.281
},
{
"chunk": 27,
"text": "It was worth it.",
"start": 512.878,
"end": 514.503
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "That night, you fit all the way inside.",
"start": 515.053,
"end": 517.445
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "You wake up, and Pip is asleep in your jacket pocket.",
"start": 517.851,
"end": 520.986
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "Warm.",
"start": 521.334,
"end": 521.845
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "Breathing.",
"start": 521.949,
"end": 522.599
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "Seven days in a world with no one.",
"start": 523.145,
"end": 525.189
},
{
"chunk": 28,
"text": "And now you have someone.",
"start": 526.203,
"end": 528.42
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "Day eight.",
"start": 529.72,
"end": 530.417
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "You dig until your arms shake.",
"start": 530.521,
"end": 532.239
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "Two and a half meters.",
"start": 532.588,
"end": 533.749
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "And at the very end, a nest, just big enough to sit up in.",
"start": 534.039,
"end": 537.626
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "A meter of soil over your head.",
"start": 538.172,
"end": 539.96
},
{
"chunk": 29,
"text": "That night, for the first time in eight days, nothing can step on you.",
"start": 540.703,
"end": 545.556
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "At midnight, you wake.",
"start": 547.506,
"end": 548.841
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Scratching at the entrance.",
"start": 549.027,
"end": 550.374
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Then sniffing.",
"start": 550.478,
"end": 551.349
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Then something coming in.",
"start": 551.895,
"end": 553.183
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "In the dark, two yellow eyes.",
"start": 553.241,
"end": 555.087
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "A feathered hunter.",
"start": 555.169,
"end": 556.202
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Fast.",
"start": 556.306,
"end": 556.898
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Only as tall as your knee.",
"start": 557.444,
"end": 558.768
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Not a T.",
"start": 558.849,
"end": 559.371
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "rex.",
"start": 559.418,
"end": 559.917
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Small enough to fit in your tunnel.",
"start": 560.022,
"end": 561.624
},
{
"chunk": 31,
"text": "Small doesn't mean safe.",
"start": 562.03,
"end": 563.621
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "Your headlamp lights it up.",
"start": 564.171,
"end": 565.506
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "It doesn't care.",
"start": 565.587,
"end": 566.528
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "It lunges.",
"start": 567.136,
"end": 567.972
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "Claws rip across your right forearm.",
"start": 568.378,
"end": 570.41
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "No knife.",
"start": 570.514,
"end": 571.141
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "No fire.",
"start": 571.246,
"end": 571.954
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "No room to swing a bone.",
"start": 572.117,
"end": 573.568
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "Just one thing this world has never seen.",
"start": 574.663,
"end": 577.403
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "You switch the phone on.",
"start": 577.868,
"end": 579.134
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "11%.",
"start": 579.273,
"end": 580.155
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "You hit the alarm and point the flashlight straight into its face.",
"start": 580.62,
"end": 583.662
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "A sound sixty-six million years too early fills the tunnel.",
"start": 584.3,
"end": 588.073
},
{
"chunk": 32,
"text": "It shrieks, and it's gone.",
"start": 589.088,
"end": 591.688
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "But it could come back.",
"start": 592.238,
"end": 593.492
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "Blood drips from your arm.",
"start": 594.235,
"end": 595.93
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "Pip creeps out of your pocket and sits by your hand.",
"start": 596.394,
"end": 599.227
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "You can't leave the light on.",
"start": 599.773,
"end": 601.178
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "It would be dead in an hour, and dawn is five hours away.",
"start": 601.236,
"end": 604.927
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "So you count.",
"start": 605.392,
"end": 606.193
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "Ten seconds of light.",
"start": 606.936,
"end": 608.085
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "One minute of dark.",
"start": 608.55,
"end": 609.618
},
{
"chunk": 33,
"text": "Every time the dark comes back, you listen for claws.",
"start": 610.163,
"end": 613.507
},
{
"chunk": 35,
"text": "When the sky turns grey, you switch it off.",
"start": 615.457,
"end": 617.918
},
{
"chunk": 35,
"text": "3%.",
"start": 619.339,
"end": 620.465
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Day nine.",
"start": 621.316,
"end": 622.059
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "You have a fever.",
"start": 622.117,
"end": 623.174
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "The wound is hot.",
"start": 623.359,
"end": 624.474
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "You wrap it in a strip torn from your t-shirt.",
"start": 624.938,
"end": 627.388
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "The entrance let a hunter in.",
"start": 627.852,
"end": 629.664
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Tomorrow, it has to keep the whole world out.",
"start": 630.07,
"end": 632.496
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "One-handed, you drag stones up from the river and stack them around the opening.",
"start": 632.961,
"end": 637.128
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Last, a big flat stone.",
"start": 637.674,
"end": 639.462
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "From inside, you can drag it across like a door, and push it aside to get out.",
"start": 640.101,
"end": 644.268
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "When it's closed, it leaves a gap a hand wide.",
"start": 645.012,
"end": 647.786
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Enough for air.",
"start": 648.042,
"end": 649.365
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Not enough for teeth.",
"start": 649.586,
"end": 650.712
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "The sun is going down when the door slides into place.",
"start": 651.583,
"end": 654.299
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Just in time.",
"start": 654.845,
"end": 655.762
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Two out of three.",
"start": 656.401,
"end": 657.306
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "Twelve dried fish won't last a winter.",
"start": 657.411,
"end": 659.524
},
{
"chunk": 36,
"text": "And you're out of days.",
"start": 659.988,
"end": 661.904
},
{
"chunk": 37,
"text": "You switch the phone on one more time.",
"start": 663.204,
"end": 665.491
},
{
"chunk": 37,
"text": "The message has changed.",
"start": 665.561,
"end": 666.919
},
{
"chunk": 37,
"text": "\"Impact: tomorrow.\"",
"start": 667.662,
"end": 669.264
},
{
"chunk": 37,
"text": "You switch it off.",
"start": 670.007,
"end": 671.842
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "That night you slide the door aside and climb out.",
"start": 672.392,
"end": 674.969
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "The sky is full of stars.",
"start": 675.434,
"end": 677.187
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "From across the river comes that low, familiar call.",
"start": 677.825,
"end": 680.995
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "The same T.",
"start": 681.541,
"end": 682.841
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "rex.",
"start": 682.945,
"end": 683.491
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "The last night of the dinosaurs.",
"start": 683.956,
"end": 685.685
},
{
"chunk": 38,
"text": "And only you know.",
"start": 685.906,
"end": 687.671
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "It isn't a strange morning.",
"start": 688.221,
"end": 689.765
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "That's what makes it strange.",
"start": 690.311,
"end": 691.971
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "Birds are singing.",
"start": 692.517,
"end": 693.55
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "Insects are buzzing.",
"start": 693.71,
"end": 694.883
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "A few triceratops are drinking across the river.",
"start": 695.231,
"end": 698.064
},
{
"chunk": 39,
"text": "None of them know.",
"start": 698.61,
"end": 700.305
},
{
"chunk": 40,
"text": "Then, in the south, a light.",
"start": 700.854,
"end": 702.921
},
{
"chunk": 40,
"text": "Not like the sun.",
"start": 703.664,
"end": 704.72
},
{
"chunk": 40,
"text": "Like someone switched the sky on by mistake.",
"start": 705.375,
"end": 708.37
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Your book said the shaking comes within minutes.",
"start": 708.92,
"end": 711.126
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "It's right.",
"start": 711.711,
"end": 712.349
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "The ground starts to move.",
"start": 712.431,
"end": 713.893
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Not like a footstep.",
"start": 714.056,
"end": 715.252
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Like the whole world.",
"start": 715.391,
"end": 716.587
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "The river pulls back.",
"start": 717.33,
"end": 718.7
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Then it comes back, the wrong way.",
"start": 718.886,
"end": 721.208
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "A wall of water runs upstream and throws fish onto the bank.",
"start": 721.614,
"end": 725.05
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "It climbs up the bank, and stops a hand below your door.",
"start": 725.689,
"end": 728.859
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "When it pulls back, you run down and grab every fish you can carry.",
"start": 729.497,
"end": 733.27
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "Food for the dark.",
"start": 734.227,
"end": 735.515
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "The last thing on your list.",
"start": 735.98,
"end": 737.466
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "The end of the world just handed it to you.",
"start": 738.012,
"end": 740.636
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "This isn't imagination.",
"start": 740.984,
"end": 742.586
},
{
"chunk": 41,
"text": "In North Dakota, scientists found fossil fish with tiny glass beads from this impact stuck in their gills.",
"start": 743.77,
"end": 750.562
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "Then those same glass beads start falling from the sky.",
"start": 751.112,
"end": 754.421
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "Small and hot, like burning hail.",
"start": 754.967,
"end": 757.37
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "The sky turns red.",
"start": 757.834,
"end": 759.378
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "You drag the door shut, hold Pip tight and crawl to the end of the tunnel.",
"start": 760.017,
"end": 764.162
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "Outside, the first trees catch fire.",
"start": 764.801,
"end": 767.471
},
{
"chunk": 42,
"text": "By evening, the whole forest is burning.",
"start": 768.017,
"end": 770.292
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "And then, outside, footsteps.",
"start": 770.842,
"end": 773.036
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Heavy.",
"start": 773.501,
"end": 774.035
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Slow.",
"start": 774.197,
"end": 774.778
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Close.",
"start": 774.894,
"end": 775.428
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Something huge collapses at your door, and its shadow covers the gap.",
"start": 775.974,
"end": 779.944
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "The T.",
"start": 780.13,
"end": 780.536
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "rex.",
"start": 780.583,
"end": 781.036
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "From day one.",
"start": 781.07,
"end": 782.011
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "The scar across its snout.",
"start": 782.475,
"end": 784.112
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Its huge snout is right against the stones.",
"start": 784.577,
"end": 786.956
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "Its hot breath fills your tunnel.",
"start": 787.502,
"end": 789.534
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "It can't get in.",
"start": 790.629,
"end": 791.558
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "It doesn't even try.",
"start": 791.593,
"end": 792.766
},
{
"chunk": 43,
"text": "It only came for the cool soil at your door, away from the fire.",
"start": 793.311,
"end": 797.63
},
{
"chunk": 44,
"text": "All night, from the other side of the stones, you hear it breathing.",
"start": 798.181,
"end": 802.14
},
{
"chunk": 44,
"text": "Each breath slower.",
"start": 802.779,
"end": 804.868
},
{
"chunk": 46,
"text": "Until morning.",
"start": 806.818,
"end": 807.747
},
{
"chunk": 48,
"text": "Then it stops.",
"start": 809.697,
"end": 810.777
},
{
"chunk": 48,
"text": "The last dinosaur you saw died at your door.",
"start": 812.197,
"end": 815.866
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "In the days after, the river rises again and buries the T.",
"start": 817.166,
"end": 820.928
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "rex in thick mud.",
"start": 820.974,
"end": 822.205
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "Buried fast in mud.",
"start": 822.669,
"end": 824.178
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "That's how bones become fossils.",
"start": 824.724,
"end": 826.558
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "You open your book to the cover.",
"start": 827.104,
"end": 828.66
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "The museum skeleton.",
"start": 828.822,
"end": 830.169
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "And this time, you look closely.",
"start": 830.459,
"end": 832.595
},
{
"chunk": 49,
"text": "A long scar, healed into the bone of the snout.",
"start": 833.436,
"end": 836.71
},
{
"chunk": 51,
"text": "The same skeleton that stood behind you in that video.",
"start": 838.66,
"end": 841.562
},
{
"chunk": 51,
"text": "The one you joked in front of.",
"start": 842.108,
"end": 843.815
},
{
"chunk": 51,
"text": "Sixty-six million years from now, it will stand in a museum.",
"start": 844.453,
"end": 847.89
},
{
"chunk": 51,
"text": "And one day, you'll stand in front of it, laughing, with no idea you were here when it died.",
"start": 848.354,
"end": 853.985
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Then the dark comes.",
"start": 854.535,
"end": 856.102
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Soot from fires all over the world, and dust from the impact, cover the whole sky.",
"start": 856.845,
"end": 862.116
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Sunlight can't get through.",
"start": 862.755,
"end": 864.136
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Plants can't grow.",
"start": 864.241,
"end": 865.541
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "And it gets cold.",
"start": 865.599,
"end": 866.76
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Scientists think this impact winter lasted months.",
"start": 867.399,
"end": 870.568
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Maybe years.",
"start": 870.789,
"end": 871.718
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "The world gave you one gift on its last day.",
"start": 872.356,
"end": 875.236
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Fire.",
"start": 875.642,
"end": 876.315
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "You carried an ember in from the burning forest.",
"start": 876.722,
"end": 879.067
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "You keep a small fire right at the gap, never deep inside.",
"start": 879.613,
"end": 883.165
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "In a closed tunnel, smoke kills quietly.",
"start": 883.804,
"end": 886.683
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "And at night, Pip sleeps against your neck.",
"start": 887.089,
"end": 889.55
},
{
"chunk": 52,
"text": "Two small bodies, keeping each other warm.",
"start": 890.293,
"end": 893.405
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "The phone won't turn on anymore.",
"start": 893.955,
"end": 895.638
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "So you scratch lines on the tunnel wall with a sharp stone.",
"start": 895.731,
"end": 898.669
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Inventory.",
"start": 899.203,
"end": 900.155
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Days after the end: 40.",
"start": 900.317,
"end": 902.198
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Still dark.",
"start": 902.349,
"end": 903.162
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Dried fish: 7.",
"start": 903.322,
"end": 904.692
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Running low.",
"start": 904.797,
"end": 905.598
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Dinosaurs left: zero.",
"start": 906.601,
"end": 908.423
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Friends: one.",
"start": 908.583,
"end": 909.756
},
{
"chunk": 53,
"text": "Mouse-sized.",
"start": 909.86,
"end": 911.079
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "You repeat the rules to yourself.",
"start": 911.63,
"end": 913.43
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "Stay small.",
"start": 913.894,
"end": 914.8
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "Stay near water.",
"start": 914.985,
"end": 916.007
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "Stay underground.",
"start": 916.193,
"end": 917.296
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "And a new one, that no book ever taught you.",
"start": 917.76,
"end": 920.198
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "Stay small…",
"start": 920.744,
"end": 921.557
},
{
"chunk": 54,
"text": "but don't stay alone.",
"start": 921.626,
"end": 923.426
},
{
"chunk": 55,
"text": "Small animals like Pip made it out of this darkness.",
"start": 923.975,
"end": 926.889
},
{
"chunk": 55,
"text": "Millions of years later, from small mammals like him, came horses, whales, apes.",
"start": 927.632,
"end": 933.1
},
{
"chunk": 55,
"text": "And people.",
"start": 933.263,
"end": 934.099
},
{
"chunk": 55,
"text": "Sixty-six million years later, one of Pip's great-great-great-grandchildren is watching this video.",
"start": 934.97,
"end": 941.297
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "And just then, from outside the tunnel, a sound.",
"start": 941.847,
"end": 944.482
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "A bird, singing.",
"start": 945.578,
"end": 946.855
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "You cross out a line on the wall, and write it again.",
"start": 947.204,
"end": 949.909
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "Dinosaurs left: zero…",
"start": 950.923,
"end": 952.804
},
{
"chunk": 56,
"text": "except the birds.",
"start": 952.874,
"end": 954.743
},
{
"chunk": 57,
"text": "On day one, what would you have done first?",
"start": 955.293,
"end": 957.603
},
{
"chunk": 57,
"text": "Tell me in the comments.",
"start": 958.346,
"end": 959.624
},
{
"chunk": 57,
"text": "And if you want to know what you and Pip did after the dark, tell me that too.",
"start": 960.262,
"end": 964.952
},
{
"chunk": 58,
"text": "Stay small.",
"start": 965.503,
"end": 966.281
},
{
"chunk": 58,
"text": "Stay alive.",
"start": 966.339,
"end": 967.361
}
]